# Cloudflare Workers — Git-connected build settings
# Dashboard → Workers & Pages → your Worker → Settings → Builds
#
# Root directory:   frontend
# Build command:    npm ci && npm run build
# Deploy command:   npx wrangler deploy
# Node.js version:  22  (set NODE_VERSION=22 in dashboard environment variables)
#
# Do NOT set CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN here — Workers Builds uses Git auth automatically.
#
# Environment variables (Production):
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://doxastudios.ca
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLARITY_ID=xxxxxxxxxx
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CALENDLY_URL=https://calendly.com/your-account/30min
